{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\ns=dict(action='review',artifact_id='b257ed38f8df4cb99a25261cfc0b2c53',rationale='Review the complete executed status-copy comparison against the explicit Config.Clone contract, including the true policy witness and false policy control.',sources=[dict(id='s-confstate-policy-observation',file='tracker/tracker.go',start_line=148,end_line=156,kind='code_observation'),dict(id='s-raw-status-entry',file='rawnode.go',start_line=496,end_line=502,kind='interface_statement')],review_items=[dict(aspect='checker_correspondence',status='no_issue_found',source_ids=['s-config-clone','s-status-config-copy','s-auto-field-contract','s-config-changer','s-raw-api','s-ready-contract','s-node-contract','s-restart','s-confstate-policy-observation','s-raw-status-entry'],rationale='Reviewed fixed artifact b257ed38f8df4cb99a25261cfc0b2c53 v1 and its plan; executable bytes match the constructed driver. Execution bcedae7735174e4cb70f70772e0c3f7d completed, with no event parsing errors and unique installed/result correlations for both cases. Applicability: Config.Clone explicitly promises a copy of Config, whose AutoLeave field distinguishes automatic from application-controlled joint exit; RawNode.Status calls getStatus, which returns that copy. This is a value-preservation requirement, not a claim about consensus failure. Producer history: initial snapshot is explicitly supplied, then the public API elects the one voter through real persisted self-vote handling and commits an actual joint configuration adding a learner. Both voting halves remain node 1; dropping messages to learner 2 cannot deprive either quorum of required support. All Ready entries and HardState are stored, committed entries applied in order, and Advance follows application. Observation: immediately after ApplyConfChange, the harness emits the actual returned ConfState.AutoLeave, then calls Status on the same thread before any Advance, proposal or delivery. ConfState reads p.AutoLeave directly, while Status uses Config.Clone; these are distinct source paths. No concurrent access or intervening transition can explain the difference. Correlation: admission_alias=installed explicitly selects configuration_installed, with case/node/index identity independent of compared policy. Entry selection is based on nonempty configuration Changes, not on true/false outcome. Both entering modes are retained. Oracle compares result.auto_leave to installed.auto_leave rather than a precomputed expected constant. Implicit mode at index 3 reports installed=true and status=false while both expose one outgoing voter. Explicit mode at index 3 reports false/false. The implicit case violates copy preservation and the explicit case is the matching control. Driver completion does not stop on or assert the forbidden comparison: it continues normal Ready/Advance work and records completion at applied index 4 for implicit and 3 for explicit. Source Clone returns map fields but omits AutoLeave, explaining the observed loss. Alternative automatic exit does not explain the false value because observation precedes Advance and the joint voter set is still present. Subsequent successful implicit exit is contrary to any claim of live policy loss, and that stronger claim is excluded.',counterevidence=[],limitations=['Only Status.Config.AutoLeave copying is checked; other status fields are not assessed.','The actual tracker retains its automatic-exit policy; this result does not establish that Status mutates protocol state.','No external operator/client decision or consensus consequence is observed.','Initial index-1 snapshot is a declared bootstrap input; subsequent election and configuration history execute.','No crash or asynchronous-storage behavior is covered.'],report_title='Status 复制配置时遗漏 AutoLeave',report_answer='已提交的固定检查中，隐式联合配置安装返回 AutoLeave=true，但紧接着调用 Status 得到 false；显式配置的 false 对照保持一致。源码中的 Config.Clone 未复制该字段，结论仅限配置状态报告错误，不代表运行中的自动退出策略被清除。')],feedback=dict(ref_ids=['b257ed38f8df4cb99a25261cfc0b2c53','bcedae7735174e4cb70f70772e0c3f7d','b-status-copy','f-auto-leave-policy','s-config-clone','s-status-config-copy'],answered='The fixed implicit case installed AutoLeave=true and immediately observed false in Status at the same configuration index 3; explicit mode preserved false. ConfState reads the live field and Status copies through Clone, which omits it. The immediate sequencing excludes a completed joint exit as explanation.',remaining=['Any downstream status-consumer consequence is outside this local copy obligation.','Automatic-exit retry after transfer timeout still lacks a grounded finite progress obligation.'],understanding='updated',rationale='The correspondence review addresses the actual fixed history, independent producer/result paths and both observed modes without retroactively treating prior exploration as evidence.'))\njson.dump(s,open('submission-status-review.json','w'),indent=2)\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-03_13-18-41-etcd_raft-real-run --submission submission-status-review.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
